	(text "C2001 and C2003 (47 uF each) bypass the input and regulated output. C2002\n(100 nF) at NR/SS filters reference noise and controls the ramp. SS_CTRL is\ngrounded, giving about 13 ms nominal soft start. C2004 (10 nF), from OUT to\nFB, improves noise and ripple rejection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 90.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04e4c25a-ca77-4847-bfb9-d30583a8c5ea")
	)
	(text "R2005 (0.05 Ohm) drops 50 mV/A after feedback: V(ANA3V3) = 3.295 V - I x 0.05\nOhm. R2006 (10 kOhm) bleeds the output. U2001 has internal current limiting,\nUVLO, thermal shutdown and active discharge. Usable load current depends on\nthermal design and the shared ANA5/ANA6 budget."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "071be618-a3b0-4d67-95b0-45d5c91973cb")
	)
	(text "Enable control"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "07e2dea5-ec33-420b-8f10-7a7de59fa564")
	)
	(text "Purpose and role"
